{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GWaDZgRMUgtPM533EV8jB3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the final decision about the `group.protocol` client configuration.\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\n**The final decision is to keep the `group.protocol` config but restrict it to a single allowed value (\\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\") in phase 3, rather than removing it entirely.**\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in **discussions.md** in the KIP-1274 discussion thread:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"AS1: In phase 3, proposes leaving `group.protocol` config but only permitting value \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" instead of removing it entirely\\\\\\\" (response from Andrew Schofield on 2026-01-28T09:50:37Z)\\\\n\\\\nThe multi-phase deprecation plan for the classic rebalance protocol is:\\\\n- **Phase 1**: Issue deprecation warning (4.3)\\\\n- **Phase 2**: Change default to \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" (5.0)\\\\n- **Phase 3**: Remove support for \\\\\\\"classic\\\\\\\" value, leaving config with only \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" permitted (6.0)\\\\n\\\\n### Source File\\\\n- **discussions.md** - Lines 2329-2351 (KIP-1274: Deprecate and remove support for Classic rebalance protocol in KafkaConsumer)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":20.43,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":171669,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":31738,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.08753889999999999,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1366}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08526771-fe7d-4612-bf5c-eb5563af3dce","uuid":"02ac057b-5ba4-4c2f-85e6-70faf87bd3d0","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:49:51.781Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the final decision about the `group.protocol` client configuration.\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\n**The final decision is to keep the `group.protocol` config but restrict it to a single allowed value (\\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\") in phase 3, rather than removing it entirely.**\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in **discussions.md** in the KIP-1274 discussion thread:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"AS1: In phase 3, proposes leaving `group.protocol` config but only permitting value \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" instead of removing it entirely\\\\\\\" (response from Andrew Schofield on 2026-01-28T09:50:37Z)\\\\n\\\\nThe multi-phase deprecation plan for the classic rebalance protocol is:\\\\n- **Phase 1**: Issue deprecation warning (4.3)\\\\n- **Phase 2**: Change default to \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" (5.0)\\\\n- **Phase 3**: Remove support for \\\\\\\"classic\\\\\\\" value, leaving config with only \\\\\\\"consumer\\\\\\\" permitted (6.0)\\\\n\\\\n### Source File\\\\n- **discussions.md** - Lines 2329-2351 (KIP-1274: Deprecate and remove support for Classic rebalance protocol in KafkaConsumer)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":20.43,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":171669,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":31738,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.08753889999999999,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1366}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the final decision about the `group.protocol` client configuration.\\n\\n## Answer\\n\\n**The final decision is to keep the `group.protocol` config but restrict it to a single allowed value (\\\"consumer\\\") in phase 3, rather than removing it entirely.**\\n\\nThis is documented in **discussions.md** in the KIP-1274 discussion thread:\\n\\n> \\\"AS1: In phase 3, proposes leaving `group.protocol` config but only permitting value \\\"consumer\\\" instead of removing it entirely\\\" (response from Andrew Schofield on 2026-01-28T09:50:37Z)\\n\\nThe multi-phase deprecation plan for the classic rebalance protocol is:\\n- **Phase 1**: Issue deprecation warning (4.3)\\n- **Phase 2**: Change default to \\\"consumer\\\" (5.0)\\n- **Phase 3**: Remove support for \\\"classic\\\" value, leaving config with only \\\"consumer\\\" permitted (6.0)\\n\\n### Source File\\n- **discussions.md** - Lines 2329-2351 (KIP-1274: Deprecate and remove support for Classic rebalance protocol in KafkaConsumer)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"index.md\",\"discussions.md\"],\"seconds\":20.43,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":171669,\"cache_write_tokens\":31738,\"cost_usd\":0.08753889999999999,\"input_tokens\":66,\"output_tokens\":1366}}"}}}
